03:45:41,730 --> 03:45:42,470
But, you know.

3650
03:45:43,570 --> 03:45:44,550
At least for me.

3651
03:45:47,460 --> 03:45:48,660
What languages do I know?

3652
03:45:48,780 --> 03:45:50,900
I know Danish, German...

3653
03:45:50,900 --> 03:45:53,220
Well, my German is getting very rusty, but...

3654
03:45:53,220 --> 03:45:54,060
German and English.

3655
03:45:54,620 --> 03:45:55,200
Three languages.

3656
03:45:59,520 --> 03:46:00,860
Maybe greed mode next time.

3657
03:46:01,340 --> 03:46:02,440
Yeah, you're right, actually.

3658
03:46:03,220 --> 03:46:06,040
Next time, I promise we're gonna do greed and challenge.

3659
03:46:06,040 --> 03:46:06,920
Just to switch it up.

3660
03:46:07,920 --> 03:46:10,240
That way I can also keep my streak of one, you know?

3661
03:46:10,940 --> 03:46:12,680
It looks nice just sitting there at one.

3662
03:46:15,300 --> 03:46:16,760
Actually, one is so sad.

3663
03:46:16,960 --> 03:46:18,540
It has to be at least two, right?

3664
03:46:18,720 --> 03:46:19,740
Otherwise, it's not a streak.

3665
03:46:20,620 --> 03:46:21,520
That's just sad.

3666
03:46:27,380 --> 03:46:31,900
I hear from Maya University that they're reworking the curriculum to accommodate AI in the current industry.

3667
03:46:32,040 --> 03:46:33,780
But to my mind, I think it will become outdated soon.

3668
03:46:37,030 --> 03:46:38,930
I mean, AI is not going anywhere.

3669
03:46:40,110 --> 03:46:41,890
It is already so incredibly useful.

3670
03:46:41,950 --> 03:46:43,290
I'm talking about coding here.

3671
03:46:44,610 --> 03:46:45,570
Programming, coding...

3672
03:46:45,570 --> 03:46:46,510
Stuff like that.

3673
03:46:47,070 --> 03:46:49,650
It is absolutely not going to go away.

3674
03:46:51,450 --> 03:46:55,610
The only choice is to embrace it or incorporate it in some capacity.

3675
03:46:58,790 --> 03:47:00,550
Your German is beautiful, not gonna lie.

3676
03:47:01,150 --> 03:47:02,310
It was once.

3677
03:47:02,910 --> 03:47:06,210
But I'm at that stage where I can understand everything perfectly.

3678
03:47:06,210 --> 03:47:10,210
If a German is speaking to me in their native language and they're just going fast and using slang...

3679
03:47:10,210 --> 03:47:11,050
No problem.

3680
03:47:11,210 --> 03:47:12,190
I understand everything.

3681
03:47:12,810 --> 03:47:15,750
But when I speak it myself, I'm having such a...

3682
03:47:16,530 --> 03:47:18,890
Lot of trouble just getting the words.

3683
03:47:19,510 --> 03:47:20,030
You know?

3684
03:47:20,090 --> 03:47:21,410
I don't have the vocabulary anymore.

3685
03:47:21,410 --> 03:47:22,770
I totally forgot most of it.

3686
03:47:23,710 --> 03:47:25,670
I know what I want to say, but I just can't.

3687
03:47:27,350 --> 03:47:28,470
Nice music, right?

3688
03:47:28,750 --> 03:47:30,010
It's from Ark Raiders.

3689
03:47:30,570 --> 03:47:33,010
It has such incredible music, that game.

3690
03:47:33,210 --> 03:47:33,750
It's wild.

3691
03:47:38,220 --> 03:47:39,180
Do you understand dialects?

3692
03:47:39,680 --> 03:47:40,240
You mean in German?

3693
03:47:40,360 --> 03:47:40,640
I do.

3694
03:47:42,000 --> 03:47:44,480
I even understand the Glasgow people now.

3695
03:47:44,680 --> 03:47:46,500
Or Limmy, in other words.

3696
03:47:46,600 --> 03:47:48,640
I've watched so much of Limmy, I can understand it.

3697
03:47:49,200 --> 03:47:51,500
At first, I had no idea what that guy was saying.

3698
03:47:51,620 --> 03:47:51,720
You know?

3699
03:47:51,780 --> 03:47:52,880
His accent was so thick.

3700
03:47:53,380 --> 03:47:54,340
But now I get it.

3701
03:47:55,700 --> 03:47:57,000
I've just heard it so much.

3702
03:47:58,960 --> 03:48:00,800
Did you see Zario beating the Ender Dragon?

3703
03:48:00,880 --> 03:48:02,100
I did actually see it.

3704
03:48:02,540 --> 03:48:03,860
I've been following his journey.

3705
03:48:05,580 --> 03:48:10,060
I even saw his video where he was reacting to the speedruns.

3706
03:48:10,060 --> 03:48:11,320
And I had this weird...

3707
03:48:12,660 --> 03:48:13,600
What do you call it?

3708
03:48:14,680 --> 03:48:17,280
Memory of me doing the exact same thing, right?

3709
03:48:17,720 --> 03:48:19,360
Like, I also beat the Ender Dragon.

3710
03:48:19,520 --> 03:48:21,040
And then, not too long after...

3711
03:48:21,040 --> 03:48:22,580
I was watching those videos.

3712
03:48:22,680 --> 03:48:23,920
It's just funny to see.

3713
03:48:28,990 --> 03:48:31,130
I'm having trouble with other Scandinavian languages.

3714
03:48:31,130 --> 03:48:32,490
Like, Swedish or Norwegian.

3715
03:48:33,130 --> 03:48:35,730
I don't understand how people in Denmark understand those people.

3716
03:48:35,830 --> 03:48:36,990
Like, I don't get it.

3717
03:48:37,110 --> 03:48:38,270
For me, it's hard to understand.

3718
03:48:38,810 --> 03:48:40,350
If it's written, I can get it.

3719
03:48:40,470 --> 03:48:41,550
But spoken?

3720
03:48:41,730 --> 03:48:41,890
No.

3721
03:48:42,050 --> 03:48:42,410
No way.

3722
03:48:46,140 --> 03:48:48,380
He watched your vid when you discovered Enchanting?

3723
03:48:48,540 --> 03:48:49,040
He did?

3724
03:48:49,940 --> 03:48:50,340
Really?

3725
03:48:51,640 --> 03:48:52,440
Oh my god.

3726
03:48:56,070 --> 03:48:56,770
No way.

3727
03:49:01,750 --> 03:49:03,270
That makes me kind of starstruck.

3728
03:49:04,590 --> 03:49:07,230
Dude, Zario is someone I've been following for so long.

3729
03:49:07,570 --> 03:49:09,850
Because he's, like, mainly a World of Warcraft streamer.

3730
03:49:09,930 --> 03:49:11,610
And I've been playing so much World of Warcraft.

3731
03:49:12,710 --> 03:49:14,110
He's so good at the game, by the way.

3732
03:49:15,090 --> 03:49:16,510
Multiple rank ones, by the way.

3733
03:49:17,210 --> 03:49:18,730
I know he likes to bring it up.

3734
03:49:18,930 --> 03:49:19,090
Yeah.

3735
03:49:19,850 --> 03:49:23,090
I remember him reaching rank one, okay?

3736
03:49:27,520 --> 03:49:30,020
Scandies understand each other, but Danes are the exception, apparently.

3737
03:49:30,400 --> 03:49:36,000
Well, it's mostly that it's the young generation that don't understand the other Scandinavian countries.

3738
03:49:36,220 --> 03:49:39,640
Like, my grandma or, you know, all the old people in this country.

3739
03:49:39,640 --> 03:49:43,640
They all perfectly understand all the Swedish people and all the Norwegian people.

3740
03:49:43,800 --> 03:49:44,160
It's weird.

3741
03:49:45,140 --> 03:49:46,780
I guess it's because of their generation.

3742
03:49:46,780 --> 03:49:48,820
They had, like, TV channels they were watching.

3743
03:49:49,200 --> 03:49:50,940
Where half of it was Swedish or whatever.

3744
03:49:51,080 --> 03:49:52,360
And that's how they learned it, I imagine.

3745
03:49:52,480 --> 03:49:52,940
I don't know.

3746
03:49:54,280 --> 03:49:55,800
But yeah, all the young people...

3747
03:49:56,200 --> 03:49:57,360
You would be...

3748
03:49:57,360 --> 03:49:59,680
Having trouble finding someone who could understand it all.

3749
03:50:03,930 --> 03:50:06,350
If you get bored of the game, will you do a spoiler stream?

3750
03:50:06,610 --> 03:50:08,210
You're talking about Binding of Isaac.

3751
03:50:09,570 --> 03:50:10,470
I don't think so.

3752
03:50:12,730 --> 03:50:16,930
I've said this before, but I think this game is a game I could see myself playing for a long time.

3753
03:50:17,250 --> 03:50:19,070
Not like a main game.

3754
03:50:19,630 --> 03:50:21,510
Just, you know, with a lower cadence.

3755
03:50:22,250 --> 03:50:26,390
And I would return to it once in a while and work on my achievements and try to get further and further.

3756
03:50:27,450 --> 03:50:30,830
It'll be like a long project, you know?

3757
03:50:32,890 --> 03:50:36,270
Maybe even at the point in the future where it's gonna be one stream a month.

3758
03:50:38,230 --> 03:50:39,090
Something like that.

3759
03:50:44,980 --> 03:50:47,100
That's like 700 hours to get full achievements.

3760
03:50:47,260 --> 03:50:47,860
Well, you know.

3761
03:50:48,860 --> 03:50:50,260
I'm 35... 34?

3762
03:50:51,360 --> 03:50:52,540
I think I'm 34...

3763
03:50:52,540 --> 03:50:53,080
Am I 35?

3764
03:50:54,120 --> 03:50:55,500
I'm 34 years old, okay?

3765
03:50:56,900 --> 03:50:59,260
And I still have like 40 years in me.

3766
03:51:01,600 --> 03:51:02,440
We'll make it happen.

3767
03:51:03,700 --> 03:51:04,520
Wait, am I 30...

3768
03:51:04,520 --> 03:51:05,540
I was born in 92.

3769
03:51:05,740 --> 03:51:06,420
How old am I, guys?

3770
03:51:09,870 --> 03:51:11,030
I don't remember.

3771
03:51:11,270 --> 03:51:11,750
Literally.

3772
03:51:12,110 --> 03:51:13,510
I'm always confused.

3773
03:51:14,730 --> 03:51:15,470
Yeah, I'm 34.

3774
03:51:15,670 --> 03:51:15,970
Thank you.

3775
03:51:16,450 --> 03:51:16,610
Good.

3776
03:51:18,410 --> 03:51:19,750
February is my birthday.

3777
03:51:22,190 --> 03:51:24,970
My favorite character is...

3778
03:51:25,630 --> 03:51:26,250
Esasel.

3779
03:51:26,570 --> 03:51:27,510
OG Esasel.

3780
03:51:27,690 --> 03:51:28,650
I gotta say it.

3781
03:51:28,810 --> 03:51:29,190
It is.

3782
03:51:31,290 --> 03:51:37,150
If it wasn't for, you know, the fact that I'm not gonna unlock anything else with him...

3783
03:51:37,150 --> 03:51:39,430
Well, there's still things I haven't done with Esasel, but...

3784
03:51:39,430 --> 03:51:40,850
I'll be playing him all the time.

3785
03:51:41,190 --> 03:51:44,710
I would be trying to master that character, you know, to its fullest.

3786
03:51:46,670 --> 03:51:48,290
I have not played him in a while, you're right.

3787
03:51:48,490 --> 03:51:51,890
But that's because I wanna unlock more stuff, you know, and get the achievements and stuff.

3788
03:51:52,490 --> 03:51:54,030
Because that unlocks new items.

3789
03:51:55,790 --> 03:51:56,950
What about Esasel?

3790
03:51:57,070 --> 03:51:57,810
He's also cool.

3791
03:51:58,210 --> 03:52:00,090
A little more difficult to play, but fun.

3792
03:52:08,170 --> 03:52:09,310
I should play more Esasel.

3793
03:52:09,370 --> 03:52:10,370
Maybe I'll play...

3794
03:52:11,690 --> 03:52:14,110
Esasel next time in one of the Greed runs.

3795
03:52:14,590 --> 03:52:14,990
No.

3796
03:52:15,390 --> 03:52:17,570
It'll have to be a character I haven't done Greed on yet.

3797
03:52:17,730 --> 03:52:19,270
And I have done Greed on Esasel.

3798
03:52:22,340 --> 03:52:23,680
What other games are on the agenda?

3799
03:52:23,800 --> 03:52:25,180
Well, Minecraft is next month.

3800
03:52:26,280 --> 03:52:27,980
I'm actually moving next month, guys.

3801
03:52:28,520 --> 03:52:29,840
At the end of next month.

3802
03:52:29,840 --> 03:52:32,360
So, it's gonna be a little bit of Minecraft Season 3.

3803
03:52:32,500 --> 03:52:33,280
And then I'm gonna have a...

3804
03:52:33,720 --> 03:52:35,060
Like, maybe half a week or so.

3805
03:52:35,460 --> 03:52:37,580
Where I'm moving to another apartment.

3806
03:52:39,240 --> 03:52:39,560
And...

3807
03:52:40,160 --> 03:52:41,540
No streams in that period, of course.

3808
03:52:41,620 --> 03:52:42,700
But then I'll be back in a new setting.

3809
03:52:43,360 --> 03:52:44,800
It's a little bit of a bigger apartment.

3810
03:52:44,800 --> 03:52:46,940
Just so Jackie has more space to run on, you know.

3811
03:52:47,680 --> 03:52:49,960
And I can actually have room for a TV.

3812
03:52:50,080 --> 03:52:52,240
Because I don't have room for a TV where I live right now.

3813
03:52:52,660 --> 03:52:53,820
It's still kinda small.

3814
03:52:54,680 --> 03:52:55,120
But yeah.

3815
03:53:00,130 --> 03:53:01,170
No, it is July.

3816
03:53:01,170 --> 03:53:03,270
But I'm moving on the 1st of August.

3817
03:53:04,870 --> 03:53:06,850
Yeah, so I guess I should have said the beginning of August.

3818
03:53:06,930 --> 03:53:07,630
And not the end of July.

3819
03:53:15,000 --> 03:53:15,540
Meep's kitten.

3820
03:53:15,700 --> 03:53:16,820
I believe so.

3821
03:53:17,000 --> 03:53:17,520
I mean...

3822
03:53:17,520 --> 03:53:20,020
We know there's animals that practically live forever, right?

3823
03:53:20,640 --> 03:53:22,840
I don't see why science couldn't get us to that point.

3824
03:53:27,600 --> 03:53:28,600
I think it'll happen.

3825
03:53:29,460 --> 03:53:30,800
Maybe not in our lifetimes.

3826
03:53:31,040 --> 03:53:32,080
I hope it does.

3827
03:53:32,340 --> 03:53:33,020
Would be cool.

3828
03:53:37,160 --> 03:53:38,700
Would be nice to live forever, you know.

3829
03:53:38,780 --> 03:53:40,240
Get to see all the games that come out.

3830
03:53:40,800 --> 03:53:42,060
See how the universe ends.

3831
03:53:43,960 --> 03:53:44,440
Finally...

3832
03:53:44,440 --> 03:53:46,140
Be part of the...

3833
03:53:46,140 --> 03:53:47,960
Alien discovery one day, you know.

3834
03:53:50,060 --> 03:53:51,760
Discovering an alien signal from space.

3835
03:53:51,760 --> 03:53:54,180
That would be so freaking cool to...

3836
03:53:54,180 --> 03:53:55,680
Be a part of, you know.

3837
03:53:55,900 --> 03:53:59,060
Or just witness the world getting killed by AI.

3838
03:53:59,660 --> 03:54:00,900
Robots taking over, you know.

3839
03:54:01,000 --> 03:54:02,820
Little nano-robots flying all over.

3840
03:54:02,980 --> 03:54:03,500
Poisoning us.

3841
03:54:04,140 --> 03:54:06,580
I mean, of all the ways to go out, that's pretty cool.

3842
03:54:07,000 --> 03:54:08,800
Imagine dying to a robot uprising.

3843
03:54:08,800 --> 03:54:11,260
That's much cooler than dying of some ulcer.

3844
03:54:11,460 --> 03:54:12,080
Or cancer.

3845
03:54:12,520 --> 03:54:12,800
Right?

3846
03:54:13,400 --> 03:54:14,700
It would be kind of hype.

3847
03:54:15,600 --> 03:54:17,000
If I'm gonna die...

3848
03:54:17,000 --> 03:54:19,140
Let it be from a robot uprising.

3849
03:54:19,660 --> 03:54:20,940
Or an alien invasion.

3850
03:54:26,400 --> 03:54:27,320
Or zombies?

3851
03:54:29,840 --> 03:54:30,940
It's not as cool.

3852
03:54:31,780 --> 03:54:33,560
Zombies are kind of yesterday, aren't they?

3853
03:54:34,080 --> 03:54:34,940
Ha ha ha ha!

3854
03:54:37,500 --> 03:54:39,780
What do you think about the next tainted character's gonna be?

3855
03:54:40,600 --> 03:54:41,000
Um...

3856
03:54:41,000 --> 03:54:43,580
Well, whatever character that I fight the key on, I guess.

3857
03:54:44,040 --> 03:54:44,800
I don't know.

3858
03:54:45,860 --> 03:54:48,120
It'll have to be up to the RNG gods up there.

3859
03:54:49,920 --> 03:54:50,700
But I would...

3860
03:54:50,700 --> 03:54:52,060
I would assume maybe Isaac?

3861
03:54:53,360 --> 03:54:54,560
Yeah, probably Isaac.

3862
03:54:54,980 --> 03:54:55,860
If I had to guess.

3863
03:54:58,320 --> 03:55:00,580
Zombies are scary, because what if the person is still in there?

3864
03:55:01,900 --> 03:55:04,140
Yeah, now I'm thinking about a movie I saw recently.

3865
03:55:05,720 --> 03:55:06,700
A horror movie.

3866
03:55:07,620 --> 03:55:09,700
If I recall, it was a horror film.

3867
03:55:10,060 --> 03:55:10,700
Ha ha ha ha!

3868
03:55:12,040 --> 03:55:12,860
You know the one.

3869
03:55:13,360 --> 03:55:14,420
Makes me think of that one.

3870
03:55:17,370 --> 03:55:21,210
If the whole world population went into a battle royale, what place would you get?

3871
03:55:22,590 --> 03:55:24,570
Oh, you mean like on the leaderboards?

3872
03:55:24,970 --> 03:55:26,650
Nah, I would be one of the first to die.

3873
03:55:27,830 --> 03:55:29,710
I have the survival instincts of a turtle.

3874
03:55:31,230 --> 03:55:35,530
Literally, I will just sit in my house, bar the doors, until they break in and kill me.

3875
03:55:38,270 --> 03:55:39,370
I can't fight.

3876
03:55:40,010 --> 03:55:41,670
I don't know how to survive out in the wild.

3877
03:55:42,030 --> 03:55:44,910
I'm totally and utterly reliant on modern civilization.

3878
03:55:47,170 --> 03:55:49,290
Like, when I don't have a dishwasher, I panic.

3879
03:55:49,730 --> 03:55:50,870
That's where I'm at in life.

3880
03:55:54,150 --> 03:55:55,230
That's a good strat, though.

3881
03:55:55,290 --> 03:55:55,890
I guess it is.

3882
03:55:57,850 --> 03:55:58,850
Maybe I could fish.

3883
03:56:02,750 --> 03:56:04,370
Nutrient myself with some good old fish?

3884
03:56:04,510 --> 03:56:05,470
I mean, how hard can it be?

3885
03:56:08,330 --> 03:56:10,530
I mean, Gollum just picks him out of the water with his hands.

3886
03:56:10,530 --> 03:56:11,090
I can do that.

3887
03:56:13,770 --> 03:56:14,830
Maybe spearfishing or something?

3888
03:56:15,090 --> 03:56:16,470
Or maybe I'll go bow hunting.

3889
03:56:19,880 --> 03:56:20,720
Ha ha ha ha!

3890
03:56:21,080 --> 03:56:22,760
This is totally not gonna happen, by the way.

3891
03:56:22,800 --> 03:56:23,640
I can't do any of that.

3892
03:56:26,900 --> 03:56:27,820
I need a new body.

3893
03:56:27,840 --> 03:56:28,860
I would like to become a robot.

3894
03:56:29,040 --> 03:56:29,180
Right?

3895
03:56:29,940 --> 03:56:33,660
People with disabilities would probably fucking welcome getting a bionic armor.

3896
03:56:33,760 --> 03:56:34,000
Or something.

3897
03:56:36,910 --> 03:56:39,110
We're moving closer to Cyberpunk 2077.

3898
03:56:42,730 --> 03:56:46,290
I saw a video on YouTube of a girl who didn't have a right arm.

3899
03:56:46,290 --> 03:56:47,450
And she had, like, a bionic arm.

3900
03:56:47,510 --> 03:56:48,690
And it looked cool as hell.

3901
03:56:49,850 --> 03:56:52,090
I think that looked so badass, you know?

3902
03:56:52,750 --> 03:56:54,550
It's probably really annoying to deal with.

3903
03:56:54,710 --> 03:56:57,290
But just from a looks perspective, it looked badass.

3904
03:56:59,270 --> 03:56:59,650
Yes.

3905
03:56:59,750 --> 03:56:59,830
Yeah.

3906
03:57:04,720 --> 03:57:07,320
Particularly a new neck, because that's causing my body to malfunction.

3907
03:57:07,480 --> 03:57:08,380
Oh man, that sucks.

3908
